REGIONAL REGULATION OF BARITO KUALA REGENCY

NUMBER 4 OF 2015

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF BARITO KUALA,

Considering:

a. that discrimination and violence against women and children constitute violations of human rights and crimes against humanity;
b. that in the context of fulfilling the constitutional rights of women and children and to improve the quality of life of women and children is one of the mandatory affairs that is the duty, authority and responsibility of the regional government;
c. that discrimination and violence against women and children in Barito Kuala Regency continues to increase and spread, causing community members to be unsafe in carrying out their lives, thus requiring integrated protection efforts;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Protection of Women and Children from Acts of Violence;

In View of:

